From: Bintec RS353 Port Kit <eisenberger@tutanota.com>
Date: Mon, 15 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] mtd: lantiq: flash map: add EBU endianness check

Der EBU-Swap (LTQ_EBU_BUSCON0 Bit 30) ist auf dem Bintec RS353 aktiv.
Der vorhandene Endianness-Workaround darf nur greifen, wenn der Swap
aus ist; sonst vertauscht er die Bytes ein zweites Mal.
Uebernommen aus dem Fork openwrt-RS353_1, Branch openwrt-22.03-old.

Signed-off-by: Bintec RS353 Port Kit <eisenberger@tutanota.com>
---
--- a/drivers/mtd/maps/lantiq-flash.c
+++ b/drivers/mtd/maps/lantiq-flash.c
@@ -187,7 +187,11 @@ ltq_mtd_probe(struct platform_device *pd
 			goto err_out;
 		}
 
-		ltq_mtd->map[i].map_priv_1 = LTQ_NOR_PROBING;
+		/* We enable the endianness workaroud only if EBU swap is enabled */
+		if (ltq_ebu_r32(LTQ_EBU_BUSCON0) & BIT(30))
+			ltq_mtd->map[i].map_priv_1 = LTQ_NOR_NORMAL;
+		else
+			ltq_mtd->map[i].map_priv_1 = LTQ_NOR_PROBING;
 		for (type = rom_probe_types; !ltq_mtd->mtd[i] && *type; type++)
 			ltq_mtd->mtd[i] = do_map_probe(*type, &ltq_mtd->map[i]);
 		ltq_mtd->map[i].map_priv_1 = LTQ_NOR_NORMAL;
@@ -203,8 +207,11 @@ ltq_mtd_probe(struct platform_device *pd
 		ltq_mtd->mtd[i]->dev.parent = &pdev->dev;
 
 		cfi = ltq_mtd->map[i].fldrv_priv;
-		cfi->addr_unlock1 ^= 1;
-		cfi->addr_unlock2 ^= 1;
+		/* We enable the endianness workaroud only if EBU swap is enabled */
+		if (!(ltq_ebu_r32(LTQ_EBU_BUSCON0) & BIT(30))) {
+			cfi->addr_unlock1 ^= 1;
+			cfi->addr_unlock2 ^= 1;
+		}
 	}
 
 	if (devices_found == 1) {
